# A card shows every typed column (KQL alignment), of the first row.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../data/orders.csv'
| summarize revenue = sum(amount), orders = count() by customerId
| top 3 by revenue desc
| take 1
| render card
---- expected
customerId | revenue | orders
string     | real    | long
-----------+---------+-------
c-042      |  1250.5 |      7
render: card y=[customerId, revenue, orders]
